B.aez=new A.hS("What time should we arrive on the tournament day?","Bag drop off & registration start from 6:00 AM - 7:00 AM. The tournament briefing and group photo will be at 7:20 AM, and tee-off (shotgun start) is at 8:00 AM sharp.")
B.aeA=new A.hS("What is the format of play?","The tournament uses the 2-Ball Scramble (Adult + Junior) format. Both players hit from the tee, select the best ball, then both play from that spot until the ball is holed. The team\u2019s score is recorded using the Stableford System 36.")
B.aeD=new A.hS("How are the junior categories divided?","\u2022 Category A (Medal A): 8\u201310 years old\n\u2022 Category B (Medal B): 11\u201313 years old\n\u2022 Category C (Medal C): 14\u201316 years old")
B.aeC=new A.hS("From which tee boxes will players tee off?","\u2022 Adult Men: Blue Tee Box\n\u2022 Adult Ladies: Red Tee Box\n\u2022 Category A (8\u201310): White Tee Box (fairway)\n\u2022 Category B (11\u201313): Red Tee Box (Boys & Girls)\n\u2022 Category C (14\u201316): Boys \u2013 Blue, Girls \u2013 Red")
B.aeF=new A.hS("What happens if there is a tie in the results?","In case of a tie, the winner will be decided in the following order:\n1. Lower handicap\n2. Last 9 holes (10\u201318)\n3. Last 6 holes (13\u201318)\n4. Last 3 holes (16\u201318)\n5. Last hole (18)")
B.aex=new A.hS("What prizes are up for grabs?","\u2022 Top 3 placings in each category (A, B, C)\n\u2022 Novelty prizes:\n  \u25e6 Nearest to Pin (NTP) \u2013 Holes #5 & #17\n  \u25e6 Bullseye Challenge \u2013 Hole #15\n\u2022 Plus: Lucky Draw prizes during prize-giving.\n\u2022 Overall Champion")
B.aey=new A.hS("When and where will lunch be served?","Lunch will be served at Cenderawasih Hall, Glenmarie GCC at 1:00 PM, followed by Crest Link\u2019s welcome session.")
B.aeE=new A.hS("Do parents/players need to know the Local Rules of Glenmarie GCC?","Yes. The event follows R&A Rules of Golf and Local Rules of Glenmarie GCC. Key rules include Out of Bounds, Penalty Areas, Drop Zones, Ground Under Repair, and Suspension of Play procedures.")
B.aeB=new A.hS("What should we do if there is a dispute during play?","All disputes must be reported to the Tournament Committee within 15 minutes after completing the round. The Committee\u2019s decision will be final.")
B.aew=new A.hS("Is there an emergency contact on the day of the event?","Yes. For emergencies, call 999 or the Duty Manager at +6011 5862 4799.")
